@WWSHA.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{WWSHA.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health

### Register a hero (201; if an incident is waiting, the hero is dispatched to it)
POST {{WWSHA.Api_HostAddress}}/api/heroes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Captain Inconvenient",
  "superpower": "Teleports people one to three feet to the left",
  "reputation": 1
}

### List available heroes
GET {{WWSHA.Api_HostAddress}}/api/heroes?available=true

### File an incident (201; auto-assigned to the oldest free hero, or left Opened)
POST {{WWSHA.Api_HostAddress}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Redmond",
  "occurredAt": "2026-11-15T12:00:00",
  "description": "Rowdy sportsball fans brawling in a bar",
  "category": "DrunkenBarFight"
}

### List in-progress incidents in Redmond
GET {{WWSHA.Api_HostAddress}}/api/incidents?status=InProgress&city=Redmond

### File a damage report (201; allowed while Opened or InProgress)
POST {{WWSHA.Api_HostAddress}}/api/incidents/{{incidentId}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Redmond",
  "description": "Table legs busted, glasses broken",
  "severity": "Minor",
  "cost": 350,
  "injury": 0
}

### Close the incident (200; assesses heroes, frees them, dispatches waiting incidents)
POST {{WWSHA.Api_HostAddress}}/api/incidents/{{incidentId}}/close

### Assessments for a hero
GET {{WWSHA.Api_HostAddress}}/api/heroes/{{heroId}}/assessments
